Monitor temperature sense: VBE + I rs against the I x R ladder over a DC temperature sweep
* Real bandgap (serdes_bias_ref), two serdes_bias_pcopy copies of @NCOPY@ fingers: one into the sense cell, one into
* the ladder (serdes_vref_gnd; every tap is read through the subcircuit nodes).
.lib "@MODEL_LIBRARY@" @SECTION@
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_primitives.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_pfet_lvt.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/cmos_logic.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/bias/spice/bandgap.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/bias/spice/bias_dist.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/monitor/spice/monitor.spice"
Vdd vdd 0 @SUPPLY@
Xref vbg i0 i1 i2 i3 vgi vdd 0 serdes_bias_ref
Vi0 i0 0 0.7
Vi1 i1 0 0.7
Vi2 i2 0 0.7
Vi3 i3 0 0.7
Xcs vs vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=@NCOPY@
Xts vs 0 serdes_tsense_vbe @TS_PARAMS@
Xcl lad vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=@NCOPY@
Xlad lad vtap vdd 0 serdes_vref_gnd @LAD_PARAMS@
.nodeset v(vbg)=1.23 v(xref.xbg.s)=1.23 v(xref.vg)=0.9 v(vgi)=0.9 v(xref.xbg.ta)=0.95 v(xref.xbg.tb)=0.95
.temp 27
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1p vntol=1u
